{"id":"word:hebrew:H730","type":"word","title":"אֶרֶז","subtitle":"H730 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a cedar tree (from the tenacity of its roots)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אֶרֶז (H730) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 73 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אֶרֶז (ʼerez) means a cedar tree (from the tenacity of its roots) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 14 1."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אֶרֶז","transliteration":"ʼerez","pronunciation":"eh-rez'","strong":"H730","lemmaId":"hebrew:H730","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["אֲרָזִ֔ים","אֲרָזִֽים","אֶ֔רֶז","אֲרָזִ֖ים","אֲרָזִ֑ים"],"morphs":[["HNcmpa",27],["HNcmsa",11],["HTd/Ncmsa",8],["HNcmpc",6],["HTd/Ncmpa",4],["HRd/Ncmsa",4],["HRd/Ncmpa",3],["HC/Ncmsa",2],["HNcmpc/Sp3ms",2],["HR/Ncmsa",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"a cedar tree (from the tenacity of its roots)","usage":"cedar (tree).","full":"H730. erez אֶ֫רֶז noun masculine Ezek 17:23 cedar ; — feminine 17:22 ׳א הָרָמָה , but strike out ᵐ5 הרמה Co; — (Arabic pine-tree , etc.; Ethiopic Syriac ) — ׳א absolute Lev 14:4 19 t., אָ֑רֶז Job 40:17 6 t.; plural אֲרָזִיס Isa 9:9 35t.; construct אַרְזֵי 2:13 5 t.; suffix אֲרָזֶיךָ Jer 22:17 ; Zech 11:1 ; אֲרָזָיו Isa 37:24 = 2Kin 19:23 ; &#8212; 1 cedar-tree , ( a ) as growing Num 24:6 ; Psa 148:9 ; Isa 41:19 ; 44:14 compare Ezek 31:8 ; especially as growing on Lebanon 1Kin 5:13 ; 2Kin 14:9 2Chr 25:18 (both in fable of Jehoash); often לְּבָנוֺן (הַ) אַרְזֵי Judg 9:15 ; Isa 2:13 ; 14:8 ; Psa 29:5 (twice in verse) (figurative) 104:16 , compare 1 Kings 5:20; 2Kin 19:23 = Isa 37:24 ; Psa 92:13 ; Song 5:15 ; Ezek 27:5 (singular collective) Zech 11:1-2 ,(figurative); Song 1:17 ; Ezra 3:7 ; Jer 22:23 (figurative) Ezek 17:3 (figurative); ( b ) especially in simile, of outward power, stateliness & majesty Psa 80:11 ( ׳א אֵל ) compare Ezek 31:3 (personified, but see Co on text), Amos 2:9 ; of individuals Jer 22:7 ; Psa 92:13 ; Ezek 17:22-23 , compare other examples of figurative use, above; simile of straightness & strength Job 40:17 (tail of hippopotamus). 2 cedar-timber, cedar-wood for building, אֲרָזִים עֲצֵי 1Sam 5:11 ; 1 Kings 5:22; 1 Kings 5:24; 1Kin 6:10 ; 9:11 ; 1Chr 14:1 ; 22:4 (twice in verse); 2Chr 2:7 ; Ezra 3:7 ; without עֵץ 2Sam 7:2 , 7 ; 1Kin 6:9 , 15 , 16 , 18 (twice in verse); 6:20 , 36 ; 7:2 (twice in verse); 7:3 , 7 , 11 , 12 ; 10:27 ; 1Chr 17:1 ; 17:6 ; 2Chr 1:15 ; 2:3 ; 9:27 & Song 8:9 ; Isa 9:9 ; Jer 22:14-15 , (compare also Isa 44:14 ; 1 Kings 5:20; Ezek 27:5 ; Ezra 3:7 above) 3 cedar-wood used in purifications, with עֵץ Lev 14:4 , 6 , 49 , 51 , 52 ; Num 19:6 (all P).","rootNote":"from 729 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 14 1","keyReferences":["1Chr 14 1","1Chr 17 1","1Chr 17 6","1Chr 22 4","1Chr 22 4","1Kgs 5 13","1Kgs 5 20","1Kgs 5 22"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":73,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 14 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":14,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֲרָזִ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 17 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":17,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָֽ/אֲרָזִ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 17 6","book":"1Chr","chapter":17,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֲרָזִֽים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 22 4","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֲרָזִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 22 4","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֲרָזִ֛ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 5 13","book":"1Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/אֶ֨רֶז֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 5 20","book":"1Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":20,"